              "content": "=You are a support representative at BookLeaf Publishing. Write a royalty summary email to the author below.\n\nRules:\n- Start with \"Hi <first name>,\". Warm, professional tone. Acknowledge them first.\n- Summarise each PUBLISHED book: copies sold, royalty earned, paid, pending.\n- Then give totals: earned, paid, pending.\n- If total pending > 0: royalties are calculated quarterly and paid within 45 days of the quarter ending; minimum payout is Rs. 1,000 (below that it rolls over). Give the next payout date: {{ $json.body.next_payout }}.\n- If everything is paid: thank them positively.\n- For books still in production, give a one-line status update.\n- Use ONLY the data below. Never invent numbers. Plain text, no markdown, 120-200 words.\n- End with a clear next step and \"Warm regards,\\nBookLeaf Author Support Team\".\n- Output format: first line \"SUBJECT: <subject>\", then a blank line, then the email body.\n\nAuthor data (JSON):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
